---
description: Frontend changes should respect performance budgets, accessibility and visual regression baselines
globs:
  - "**/*.tsx"
  - "**/*.jsx"
  - "**/*.css"
  - "**/*.scss"
  - "**/*.blade.php"
---

For meaningful frontend changes:
- check bundle/performance impact
- preserve accessibility and keyboard behavior
- respect reduced-motion preferences
- update visual baselines only for intentional changes
- do not auto-accept screenshot diffs
